On the other hand, Proposition \ref{prop:existence_margin} gives
\begin{align}
    {\hat{\Gamma}}({q}_0'') \le \frac{266.45}{(f(1)-f(0))^2} d \log \left( \frac{2n}{\varepsilon} \right)
