for ${q}_0''=\frac 1 {d+1}\in \left(\frac{{L}}{d},\frac{1}{d}\right)$.
Since
\begin{align}
    \min \left\{ \frac{1}{(f(1)-f(0))^2} , \frac{({U}-1)^2}{(f({U})-f(1))^2} \right\}
