    &\le 125339 \times \min \left\{ \frac{1}{(f(d)-f(d-1))^2} , \frac{(d-1-{L})^2}{(f(d-1)-f({L}))^2} \right\} \times d\log \left( \frac{2n}{\varepsilon } \right) \notag\\
    &\le 250678 \times \frac{(d-{L})^2}{(f(d)-f({L}))^2}  d\log \left( \frac{2n}{\varepsilon } \right) \notag\\
    &= 250678 \times \frac{1}{{\beta}^2} \left( \frac{{U}-{L}}{f({U})-f({L})} \right)^2  d\log \left( \frac{2n}{\varepsilon } \right) \notag\\ 
    &\le { 376017 \times \frac{1}{{\beta}^2} \left( \frac{{U}-{L}}{f({U})-f({L})} \right)^2 d\log \left( \frac{2n}{\varepsilon } \right)}
