    &\ge {q}_0^{d-1} (1-{q}_0)^{1} (f(d) - f(d-1)) \\ 
    &= \left( 1-\frac{1}{d+1} \right)^d \frac{f(d)-f(d-1)}{d} \\
    &\ge \frac{f(d) - f(d-1)}{ed}. 
\end{align*}
Then, plugging this into \eqref{eq:def:fTp}, we obtain
\begin{align*}
