    &\leq 266.45 \times \frac{4}{(f(2)-f(0))^2}  d\log \left( \frac{2n}{\varepsilon } \right) \notag\\
    &= 266.45 \times \frac{1}{{\beta}^2} \left( \frac{{U}-{L}}{f({U})-f({L})} \right)^2  d\log \left( \frac{2n}{\varepsilon } \right) \notag\\
    &\le { 376017 \times \frac{1}{{\beta}^2} \left( \frac{{U}-{L}}{f({U})-f({L})} \right)^2 d\log \left( \frac{2n}{\varepsilon } \right)} 
