This along with the definitions of ${H(f)}$ and ${\beta}$ in \eqref{eq:def:sensi:para} and \eqref{eq:def:beta}, respectively, yields
\begin{align}
    {\hat{\Gamma}} ({q}_0) \leq 376017 {H(f)} d\log \left( \frac{2n}{\varepsilon } \right) 
